sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant P as TeamDelegationPopover
    participant API as Remote API
    participant T as Teammate Agent
    participant L as Lead Session

    U->>P: Click team icon in footer
    P->>API: GET /api/agents
    API-->>P: Agent list (id, label, status)
    P->>P: Filter out current agent
    U->>P: Select agents + write task
    U->>P: Click "Delega"

    loop For each selected agent
        P->>API: POST /api/execute<br/>(agentId, prompt, leadSessionId, projectPath)
        API->>T: Create session with [Team] prefix
        API-->>P: { success, sessionId }
    end

    P->>U: Close popover

    Note over T: Teammate works on task...

    T->>T: Stream ends + leadSessionId present
    T->>T: Auto-set status: done + completedAt
    T->>API: POST /api/sessions/:leadSessionId/send
    API->>L: Inject notification message
    L-->>U: "🦆 [Team Complete] Agent X ha completato..."
